# Everything in this repo is LF. Most of it is read by bash (Git Bash) or by a
# Linux container, where a stray CR ends up inside the command or the value: a
# script dies with `$'\r': command not found`, and a docker compose env_file entry
# carries the CR on into the container. Normalizing on the way in keeps CRLF
# out of the repo whatever wrote the file.

* text=auto eol=lf
